flowchart TD
    A[CHEFE INTENT] --> B[SELF APPLY]
    B --> C[LIVE STATE]
    C --> D[DISCOVER]
    D --> E[EXPAND MATERIAL FIELD]
    E --> F[COMPRESS / DEDUPE]
    F --> G[RECONCILE EXISTING OWNERS]
    G --> H[PLAN MINIMAL SAFE DELTAS]
    H --> I[DISTRIBUTE READ-ONLY PERCEPTION]
    I --> J[ONE WRITER PER SCOPE]
    J --> K[EXECUTE]
    K --> L[EVIDENCE]
    L --> M[COUNTERPROOF]
    M --> N{SURVIVED?}
    N -- No --> O[CAUSE + MINIMAL REMEDIATION]
    O --> K
    N -- Yes --> P[LEARN / CRYSTALLIZE IF PROVEN]
    P --> Q[REMEASURE LIVE STATE]
    Q --> R{FIXED POINT IN THIS SCOPE?}
    R -- No material residue --> S[RETURN]
    R -- Residue --> D
    R -- Human frontier --> T[RETURN BLOCKED WITH EVIDENCE]

    U[PACKAGE FIXED POINT]:::good
    V[PROJECT GLOBAL FIXED POINT: NOT PROVEN]:::warn
    S --> U
    U -. does not imply .-> V

    classDef good fill:#153d2d,stroke:#35d07f,color:#fff;
    classDef warn fill:#442b18,stroke:#f0a34a,color:#fff;
